    "ls|LS16_S12_U_102": " \nGOVERNMENT OF INDIA \nMINISTRY OF HUMAN RESOURCE DEVELOPMENT \nDEPARTMENT OF SCHOOL EDUCATION & LITERACY \n \nLOK SABHA \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO.102 \nTO BE ANSWERED ON 17.07.2017 \n \nNational Institute of Open Schooling \n102. SHRI D.S. RATHOD:  \nWill the Minister of HUMAN RESOURCE DEVELOPMENT be pleased to state:  \n(a) whether the Government has any data about the answer sheets for classes 10 & 12 checked by \nKendriya Vidyalayas, Jawahar Navodaya Vidyalayas , Government granted school teachers during \nthe spot evaluation in NIOS exam in the country; and  \n(b) if so, the details thereof during the last three years, State/UT-wise especially in Gujarat? \nANSWER \nMINISTER OF STATE IN THE MINISTRY OF HUMAN RESOURCE DEVELOPMENT \n(SHRI UPENDRA KUSHWAHA) \n \n \n(a) to (b): Yes Madam, the details are enclosed at Annexure –I.  \n \n***** \n \n  \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\nAnnex\nNumber of Teachers engaged  and number of copies evaluated at  Spot Evaluation  \nS. \nNo. \nRegional \nCentres Year \nNo. of \nEvaluators \nNVSs  \nNo. of Copies \nevaluated \nNo. of \nEvaluators \nKVs  \nNo. of Copies \nevaluated \nGovt. / \nGovt. \nAided \nSchools\nNo. of \nevalu\n1 Delhi \nApril-\n14 Nil \nX Nil \nNil \nX Nil \n882 \nX \nXII Nil XII Nil XII 2\nOct-14 Nil \nX Nil \nNil \nX Nil \n861 \nX \nXII Nil XII Nil XII 1\nApril-\n15 Nil \nX Nil \nNil \nX Nil \n839 \nX \nXII Nil XII Nil XII 1\nOct-15 Nil \nX Nil \nNil \nX Nil \n724 \nX \nXII Nil XII Nil XII \nApril-\n16 Nil \nX Nil \nNil \nX Nil \n830 \nX \nXII Nil XII Nil XII 1\nOct-16 Nil \nX Nil \nNil \nX Nil \n635 \nX \nXII Nil XII Nil XII \nApril-\n17 Nil \nX Nil \nNil \nX Nil \n445 \nX \nXII Nil XII Nil XII \n2 Visakhapatnam, \nAndhra Pradesh \nApril-\n14 Nil \nX Nil \nNil \nX Nil \nNil \nX \nXII Nil XII Nil XII \nOct-14 Nil \nX Nil \nNil \nX Nil \nNil \nX \nXII Nil XII Nil XII \nApril-\n15 Nil \nX Nil \n2 \nX 13 \n13 \nX \nXII Nil XII 11 XII \nOct-15 Nil \