\nChital wana, Aklera, Bhawanimandi, Bawdi, Bapini, Dechu, Lohawat, Pipar City, \nSekhala, Tinwari, Mandrayal, Didwana, Nawa, Nagaur, Chauth ka Barwada, \nJhallara, Kurabad, Falasiya, Sarada & Gogunda. \n \n*****  \n\n8 \n \nANNEXURE – III \n \nANNEXURE REFERRED TO IN REPLY TO PART (d) OF LOK SABHA STARRED QUESTION NO. 205 \nRAISED BY SHRI RAJAN VICHARE & SHRI RAOS AHEB DANVE PATIL, HON’BLE MPs TO BE \nANSWERED ON 31 ST JULY 2017 REGARDING KENDRIYA VIDYALAYAS/JAWAHAR NAVODAYA \nVIDYALAYAS/ KASTURBA GANDHI VIDYALAYAS \n \nSTATE-WISE/REGION-WISE NAMES OF 148 DISTRICTS ALL OVER THE COUNTRY WHICH DO NOT \nHAVE ANY KENDRIYA VIDYALAYA (AS ON 17.07.2017) \n \nSl. No.  State/UT No. of KVs Name of District \n1. Arunachal Pradesh 5 East Kameng, Kurung Kumey, UpperDibongValley, Upper \nSubansiri & Anjaw \n2. Assam 2 Nalbari & Chirang \n3. A & NIslands (UT) 2 Nicobar & North & Middle Andaman \n4. Bihar 7 Arwal, Kaimur, Sheikhpura, Nawada, Madhepura, \nMadhubani & Supaul.              \n5. Chhattisgarh 10 Kabirdham (Kawardha), Sukuma, Kondagaon, Balod, \nBemetara, Baloda Bazar, Gariaband, Mungeli, Surajpur & \nBalrampur. \n6.  Daman & Diu (UT) 1 Daman \n7. Delhi (UT) 2 South East Delhi & North Delhi \n8. Gujarat 7 Amreli, Kheda, Narmada, Navsari, Valsad, Dangs & Tapi \n9. Haryana 4 Kaithal, Mewat, Yamuna Nagar & Panipat \n10. Himachal Pradesh 1 Sirmaur \n11. Jammu & Kashmir 6 Poonch, Ramban, Ganderbal, Shopian, Kupwara & Pulwama\n12. Jharkhand 6 Chatra, Dumka, Giridih, Koderma, Saraikela  Kharsawan & \nPalamu             \n13. Karnataka 7 Bangalore Rural, Chitr adurga, Gadag, Ramanagara, \nChikkaballapur, Yadgir & Chickmaglur \n14. Madhya Pradesh 1 Alirajpur \n15. Maharashtra  \n17 \nAkola, Amravati, Beed, Buldhana, Gadchiroli, Gondiya, \nHingoli, Jalna, Kolhapur, Nandurbar, Usmanabad, Parbhani, \nRatnagiri, Sangli, Satara, Sindhudurga & Washim \n16. Manipur 4 Chandel, Imphal (East), Thoubal & Bishnupur \n17. Meghalaya  \n8 \nSouth Garo Hills, East Garo H ills,  North Garo Hills